OL,3,AMeta strikes deal to stop Mark
OL,4,AZuckerberg leaving California over
OL,5,Abillionaire tax
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe measure, which would impose a
OL,8,Fone-time 5% tax on state residents with
OL,9,Fa net worth of more than $1bn (#750m),
OL,10,Fis yet to pass. Californian residents
OL,11,Fwill vote on 3 November.
OL,13,FNevertheless, Zuckerberg secured a deal
OL,14,Fwith a special committee at Meta after
OL,15,F"robust", and "at several points,
OL,16,Fcontentious" negotiations.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
